<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><edmx:Edmx Version="1.0" xmlns:edmx="http://schemas.microsoft.com/ado/2007/06/edmx" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><edmx:DataServices m:DataServiceVersion="2.0" xmlns:m="http://schemas.microsoft.com/ado/2007/08/dataservices/metadata"><Schema Namespace="SFODataSet" xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/ado/2008/09/edm" xmlns:sf="http://www.successfactors.com/edm/sf" xmlns:sap="http://www.sap.com/Protocols/SAPData"><EntityContainer Name="EntityContainer" m:IsDefaultEntityContainer="true"><EntitySet Name="JobOfferTemplate_Standard_Offer_Details" EntityType="SFOData.JobOfferTemplate_Standard_Offer_Details" sap:label="JobOfferTemplate_Standard_Offer_Details" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Template</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the job requisition template as defined in provisioning.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobRequisitionLocale" EntityType="SFOData.JobRequisitionLocale" sap:label="JobRequisitionLocale" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Locale</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents the data about external/internal job description header, footer, external/internal title, external/internal description, status in different locale</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobReqQuestion" EntityType="SFOData.JobReqQuestion" sap:label="JobReqQuestion" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Questions</Summary><LongDescription>Allow to populate questions on Job Requisition using questionId</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobRequisitionGroupOperator" EntityType="SFOData.JobRequisitionGroupOperator" sap:label="JobRequisitionGroupOperator" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Group Operator</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents users associated Job Requistion such as the hiring manager. Includes the job requisition group operator data which includes operator group id, group name, operator type. If an operator group is defined in the admin settings and the same operator is defined in any of the job requisition template, then the operator group will have an entry in JobRequisition entity </LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobRequisitionPosting" EntityType="SFOData.JobRequisitionPosting" sap:label="JobRequisitionPosting" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Posting</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents the job requisition posting details</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobRequisition" EntityType="SFOData.JobRequisition" sap:label="JobRequisition" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition</Summary><LongDescription>The job requisition entity contains core requisition data consisting of system, standard and custom fields. The metadata will show the standard and custom fields configured in all the active templates. If a field (standard or custom) is not configured in any of the active template, then it will not show up in the metadata and not be a part of OData query</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag><sap:tag>Recommended</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobAppTemplate_NXGEN_Candidate_Detail_Info_Template" EntityType="SFOData.JobAppTemplate_NXGEN_Candidate_Detail_Info_Template" sap:label="JobAppTemplate_NXGEN_Candidate_Detail_Info_Template" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Template</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the job requisition template as defined in provisioning.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobReqScreeningQuestionChoice" EntityType="SFOData.JobReqScreeningQuestionChoice" sap:label="JobReqScreeningQuestionChoice" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Screening Questions Choice</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents the possible choices of MULTI_CHOICE and RATING JobReq Question types.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobOfferTemplate_Standard_Offer_Details_US" EntityType="SFOData.JobOfferTemplate_Standard_Offer_Details_US" sap:label="JobOfferTemplate_Standard_Offer_Details_US" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Template</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the job requisition template as defined in provisioning.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobOfferTemplate_Offer_Details_for_India" EntityType="SFOData.JobOfferTemplate_Offer_Details_for_India" sap:label="JobOfferTemplate_Offer_Details_for_India" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Template</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the job requisition template as defined in provisioning.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobOfferTemplate_Offer_Details_CEO_Approval_Required" EntityType="SFOData.JobOfferTemplate_Offer_Details_CEO_Approval_Required" sap:label="JobOfferTemplate_Offer_Details_CEO_Approval_Required" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Template</Summary><LongDescription>These entities represent the job requisition template as defined in provisioning.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="JobRequisitionOperator" EntityType="SFOData.JobRequisitionOperator" sap:label="JobRequisitionOperator" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Job Requisition Operator</Summary><LongDescription>This entity represents the job requisition operator user data which includes user system id, first name, last name, email, fax and phone number. If an operator is defined in any of the job requisition template, then the operator will have an entry in JobRequisition entity</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Recruiting (RCM)</sap:tag><sap:tag>RCM - Job Requisition</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection